---
import ProjectLayout from "../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro";
---

<ProjectLayout
  title="Modernising CI/CD for 17 legacy Java applications — Celia Rico"
  description="Turning a Jenkins Freestyle and WebLogic 11g deployment process into a reusable architecture built on Jenkins Pipeline, Shared Libraries, Nexus and WebLogic 14c — without touching the applications' code."
  pageType="detail"
>
  <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
  <section class="sk-hero" id="sk-hero">
    <div class="sk-hero__inner">
      <a href="/projects" class="sk-back" data-reveal>
        <span aria-hidden="true">←</span>
        <span lang="en">All projects</span>
        <span lang="es">Todos los proyectos</span>
      </a>

      <span class="sk-tag" data-reveal data-d="40">
        <span lang="en">Platform Engineering</span>
        <span lang="es">Ingeniería de plataforma</span>
      </span>

      <h1 class="sk-hero__headline" data-reveal data-d="80">
        <span lang="en">Modernising CI/CD for 17 legacy Java applications</span>
        <span lang="es"
          >Modernización de CI/CD para 17 aplicaciones Java legacy</span
        >
      </h1>

      <p class="sk-hero__description" data-reveal data-d="120">
        <span lang="en"
          >Turning a Jenkins Freestyle and WebLogic 11g deployment process into
          a reusable architecture built on Jenkins Pipeline, Shared Libraries,
          Nexus and WebLogic 14c — without touching the applications' code.</span
        >
        <span lang="es"
          >Transformar un proceso de despliegue basado en Jenkins Freestyle y
          WebLogic 11g en una arquitectura reutilizable con Jenkins Pipeline,
          Shared Libraries, Nexus y WebLogic 14c, sin tocar el código de las
          aplicaciones.</span
        >
      </p>

      <div class="sk-meta-grid" data-reveal data-d="160">
        <div class="sk-meta-cell">
          <div class="sk-meta-cell__label">
            <span lang="en">Client</span>
            <span lang="es">Cliente</span>
          </div>
          <div class="sk-meta-cell__value">ERHARDT Serikat</div>
        </div>
        <div class="sk-meta-cell">
          <div class="sk-meta-cell__label">
            <span lang="en">Duration</span>
            <span lang="es">Dedicación</span>
          </div>
          <div class="sk-meta-cell__value">
            <span lang="en">120h of work</span>
            <span lang="es">120h de trabajo</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="sk-meta-cell">
          <div class="sk-meta-cell__label">
            <span lang="en">Initial scope</span>
            <span lang="es">Alcance inicial</span>
          </div>
          <div class="sk-meta-cell__value">
            <span lang="en">17 Java apps</span>
            <span lang="es">17 apps Java</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="sk-meta-cell sk-meta-cell--accent">
          <div class="sk-meta-cell__label sk-meta-cell__label--light">
            <span lang="en">Status</span>
            <span lang="es">Estado</span>
          </div>
          <div class="sk-meta-cell__value sk-meta-cell__value--light">
            <span lang="en">Validated</span>
            <span lang="es">Validado</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sk-tech-tags" data-reveal data-d="200">
        {
          [
            "Jenkins Pipeline",
            "Groovy",
            "Jenkins Shared Library",
            "Maven",
            "Nexus",
            "WebLogic 14c",
            "GitLab",
            "SSH / SCP",
          ].map((t) => <span class="sk-tech-tag">{t}</span>)
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ SUMMARY ============ -->
  <section class="sk-section" id="sk-summary">
    <div class="sk-section__inner">
      <span class="sk-section-label" data-reveal>
        <span lang="en">Project summary</span>
        <span lang="es">Resumen del proyecto</span>
      </span>

      <div class="sk-summary-table" data-reveal data-d="40">
        <div class="sk-summary-row">
          <span class="sk-summary-row__key">
            <span lang="en">Direct client</span>
            <span lang="es">Cliente directo</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sk-summary-row__val">ERHARDT Serikat</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sk-summary-row">
          <span class="sk-summary-row__key">
            <span lang="en">End client</span>
            <span lang="es">Cliente final</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sk-summary-row__val">
            <span lang="en">Confidential</span>
            <span lang="es">Confidencial</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="sk-summary-row">
          <span class="sk-summary-row__key">
            <span lang="en">Project type</span>
            <span lang="es">Tipo de proyecto</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sk-summary-row__val">
            <span lang="en"
              >Architecture and implementation of a CI/CD platform</span
            >
            <span lang="es"
              >Arquitectura e implementación de una plataforma CI/CD</span
            >
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="sk-summary-row">
          <span class="sk-summary-row__key">
            <span lang="en">Initial scope</span>
            <span lang="es">Alcance inicial</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sk-summary-row__val">
            <span lang="en"
              >17 Java enterprise applications, architected to absorb future
              migrations</span
            >
            <span lang="es"
              >17 aplicaciones Java enterprise, con arquitectura preparada para
              nuevas migraciones</span
            >
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="sk-summary-row">
          <span class="sk-summary-row__key">
            <span lang="en">Delivered implementation</span>
            <span lang="es">Implementación realizada</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sk-summary-row__val">
            <span lang="en"
              >17 main pipelines, 5 additional variants and one central
              orchestrator</span
            >
            <span lang="es"
              >17 pipelines principales, 5 variantes adicionales y un
              orquestador central</span
            >
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="sk-summary-row">
          <span class="sk-summary-row__key">
            <span lang="en">Dedication</span>
            <span lang="es">Dedicación</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sk-summary-row__val">
            <span lang="en">120 hours of work</span>
            <span lang="es">120 horas de trabajo</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="sk-summary-row">
          <span class="sk-summary-row__key">
            <span lang="en">Responsibility</span>
            <span lang="es">Responsabilidad</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sk-summary-row__val">
            <span lang="en"
              >Analysis, design, implementation, testing and technical
              coordination</span
            >
            <span lang="es"
              >Análisis, diseño, implementación, pruebas y coordinación técnica</span
            >
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="sk-summary-row">
          <span class="sk-summary-row__key">
            <span lang="en">Validated environment</span>
            <span lang="es">Entorno validado</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sk-summary-row__val">
            <span lang="en"
              >Development, with the legacy platform running in parallel</span
            >
            <span lang="es"
              >Desarrollo, con la plataforma legacy operativa en paralelo</span
            >
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="sk-summary-row">
          <span class="sk-summary-row__key">
            <span lang="en">Delivery status</span>
            <span lang="es">Estado de la entrega</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sk-summary-row__val">
            <span lang="en"
              >Validated solution, ready for transition to production</span
            >
            <span lang="es"
              >Solución validada y preparada para su transición a producción</span
            >
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <blockquote class="sk-pullquote" data-reveal data-d="80">
        <p class="sk-pullquote__text">
          <span lang="en"
            >"The goal wasn't to replace what was old with something more
            modern. It was to reduce the risk of a complex migration, and turn a
            process that was hard to maintain into something reusable, traceable
            and understandable."</span
          >
          <span lang="es"
            >"El objetivo no era sustituir lo antiguo por algo técnicamente más
            moderno. Era reducir el riesgo de una migración compleja y convertir
            un proceso difícil de mantener en una base reutilizable, trazable y
            comprensible."</span
          >
        </p>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 01 CONTEXT + CONSTRAINT ============ -->
  <section class="sk-section sk-section--alt" id="sk-context">
    <div class="sk-section__inner">
      <span class="sk-section-label" data-reveal>
        <span lang="en">01 — Starting point</span>
        <span lang="es">01 — Punto de partida</span>
      </span>

      <h2 class="sk-h2" data-reveal data-d="40">
        <span lang="en"
          >A working system that no one could safely change quickly.</span
        >
        <span lang="es"
          >Un sistema funcional que nadie podía cambiar rápido con seguridad.</span
        >
      </h2>

      <p class="sk-body" data-reveal data-d="80">
        <span lang="en"
          >Seventeen interdependent Java enterprise applications, deployed
          through Jenkins Freestyle jobs and application-specific scripts on a
          legacy WebLogic platform. The brief wasn't just to keep these 17
          running — the architecture had to let the client add new migrations
          over time without a redesign.</span
        >
        <span lang="es"
          >17 aplicaciones Java enterprise interdependientes, desplegadas
          mediante jobs Jenkins Freestyle y scripts específicos por aplicación
          sobre una plataforma WebLogic legacy. El encargo no era solo mantener
          esas 17 en marcha: la arquitectura debía permitir incorporar nuevas
          migraciones sin rediseñarla.</span
        >
      </p>

      <div class="sk-split2" data-reveal data-d="120">
        <div>
          <span class="sk-sublabel">
            <span lang="en">What the old process cost</span>
            <span lang="es">Lo que costaba el proceso anterior</span>
          </span>
          <ul class="sk-bullet-list">
            <li>
              <span lang="en">Logic duplicated across every application.</span>
              <span lang="es"
                >La lógica estaba duplicada entre aplicaciones.</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span lang="en">Changes had to be applied job by job.</span>
              <span lang="es">Los cambios debían aplicarse job por job.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span lang="en"
                >Configuration, paths and behaviour tightly coupled.</span
              >
              <span lang="es"
                >Configuración, rutas y comportamiento fuertemente acoplados.</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span lang="en"
                >Part of the process depended on tacit knowledge and
                unconventional filesystem structures.</span
              >
              <span lang="es"
                >Parte del funcionamiento dependía de conocimiento tácito y
                estructuras de filesystem poco convencionales.</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span lang="en"
                >A full deployment meant running multiple jobs manually, in a
                specific order.</span
              >
              <span lang="es"
                >El despliegue completo exigía ejecutar manualmente varios jobs
                en un orden concreto.</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span lang="en"
                >Processes were hard to version, review and evolve safely.</span
              >
              <span lang="es"
                >Los procesos eran difíciles de versionar, revisar y evolucionar
                con seguridad.</span
              >
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="sk-sublabel">
            <span lang="en">The hard constraint</span>
            <span lang="es">La restricción clave</span>
          </span>
          <p class="sk-body sk-body--sm">
            <span lang="en"
              >Modernisation had to happen without touching the applications'
              pom.xml files or code — ruling out an idealised migration where
              every project adopted one uniform structure.</span
            >
            <span lang="es"
              >La modernización debía hacerse sin modificar los pom.xml ni el
              código de las aplicaciones, descartando una migración idealizada
              con una estructura uniforme para todos los proyectos.</span
            >
          </p>
          <ul class="sk-bullet-list sk-bullet-list--muted">
            <li>
              <span lang="en"
                >Application-specific Maven profiles and filters.</span
              >
              <span lang="es">Perfiles y filtros Maven específicos.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span lang="en">JAR, WAR, EAR and multi-module projects.</span>
              <span lang="es">Proyectos JAR, WAR, EAR y multimódulo.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span lang="en">Historic web.xml structures.</span>
              <span lang="es">Estructuras históricas de web.xml.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span lang="en"
                >External configuration generated during the build.</span
              >
              <span lang="es"
                >Configuración externa generada durante el build.</span
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              <span lang="en">Static resources published to Apache.</span>
              <span lang="es">Recursos estáticos publicados en Apache.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span lang="en"
                >Different paths, targets and deployment variants.</span
              >
              <span lang="es"
                >Distintas rutas, targets y variantes de despliegue.</span
              >
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 02 ARCHITECTURE ============ -->
  <section class="sk-section" id="sk-arch">
    <div class="sk-section__inner">
      <span class="sk-section-label" data-reveal>
        <span lang="en">02 — The architecture</span>
        <span lang="es">02 — La arquitectura</span>
      </span>

      <h2 class="sk-h2" data-reveal data-d="40">
        <span lang="en"
          >Separate what's common from what's specific — without ignoring real
          constraints.</span
        >
        <span lang="es"
          >Separar lo común de lo específico, sin ignorar las restricciones
          reales.</span
        >
      </h2>

      <p class="sk-body" data-reveal data-d="80">
        <span lang="en"
          >The core of the solution combined three elements, plus a central
          orchestrator to run applications in the required order.</span
        >
        <span lang="es"
          >La pieza central combinó tres elementos, más un orquestador central
          para ejecutar las aplicaciones en el orden requerido.</span
        >
      </p>

      <!-- Pipeline flow -->
      <div class="sk-flow-card" data-reveal data-d="120">
        <span class="sk-sublabel">
          <span lang="en">Pipeline flow, per application</span>
          <span lang="es">Flujo del pipeline, por aplicación</span>
        </span>
        <div class="sk-flow-steps">
          {
            [
              {
                en: "Checkout by branch or tag",
                es: "Checkout por branch o tag",
              },
              { en: "Maven build", es: "Build Maven" },
              {
                en: "Adaptations for legacy structures",
                es: "Adaptaciones de estructuras legacy",
              },
              {
                en: "External configuration generation",
                es: "Generación de configuración externa",
              },
              {
                en: "Publication and validation in Nexus",
                es: "Publicación y validación en Nexus",
              },
              {
                en: "Transfer via SSH/SCP",
                es: "Transferencia por SSH/SCP",
              },
              {
                en: "Optional static-resource publishing",
                es: "Publicación opcional de recursos estáticos",
              },
              {
                en: "Deployment on WebLogic 14c, with validation",
                es: "Despliegue sobre WebLogic 14c, con validación",
              },
            ].map((step, i, arr) => (
              <div class="sk-flow-step">
                <span class="sk-flow-step__dot" aria-hidden="true" />
                {i < arr.length - 1 && (
                  <span class="sk-flow-step__line" aria-hidden="true" />
                )}
                <span class="sk-flow-step__text">
                  <span lang="en">{step.en}</span>
                  <span lang="es">{step.es}</span>
                </span>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Three pillars -->
      <div class="sk-pillars" data-reveal data-d="160">
        <div class="sk-pillar">
          <span class="sk-pillar__tag">
            <span lang="en">Logic</span>
            <span lang="es">Lógica</span>
          </span>
          <p class="sk-pillar__body">
            <span lang="en"
              >Versioned once in the Shared Library, instead of duplicated
              across 17+ Freestyle jobs.</span
            >
            <span lang="es"
              >Versionada una sola vez en la Shared Library, en lugar de
              duplicada en más de 17 jobs Freestyle.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="sk-pillar">
          <span class="sk-pillar__tag">
            <span lang="en">Configuration</span>
            <span lang="es">Configuración</span>
          </span>
          <p class="sk-pillar__body">
            <span lang="en"
              >Externalised via Jenkins Managed Files — changeable without
              touching pipeline logic.</span
            >
            <span lang="es"
              >Externalizada mediante Jenkins Managed Files: se puede cambiar
              sin tocar la lógica de los pipelines.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="sk-pillar">
          <span class="sk-pillar__tag">
            <span lang="en">Secrets</span>
            <span lang="es">Secretos</span>
          </span>
          <p class="sk-pillar__body">
            <span lang="en"
              >Stored in Jenkins Credentials, referenced by the pipelines
              instead of hardcoded.</span
            >
            <span lang="es"
              >Almacenados en Jenkins Credentials, referenciados por los
              pipelines en lugar de estar hardcodeados.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 03 RESOLVING LEGACY ============ -->
  <section class="sk-section sk-section--alt" id="sk-legacy">
    <div class="sk-section__inner">
      <span class="sk-section-label" data-reveal>
        <span lang="en">03 — Resolving legacy without relocating it</span>
        <span lang="es">03 — Resolver lo legacy sin trasladarlo</span>
      </span>

      <h2 class="sk-h2" data-reveal data-d="40">
        <span lang="en"
          >Wrapping old scripts isn't modernisation. Absorbing their behaviour
          is.</span
        >
        <span lang="es"
          >Envolver scripts antiguos no es modernizar. Absorber su
          comportamiento, sí.</span
        >
      </h2>

      <div class="sk-legacy-cards" data-reveal data-d="80">
        <div class="sk-legacy-card">
          <span class="sk-legacy-card__title">
            <span lang="en">Normalising web.xml</span>
            <span lang="es">Normalización de web.xml</span>
          </span>
          <p class="sk-legacy-card__body">
            <span lang="en"
              >Some WAR modules kept their web.xml in non-standard locations.
              The pipeline split the build into phases — compile, detect WAR
              modules and their effective paths, normalise the descriptor at the
              right point in the Maven lifecycle, then continue packaging
              without a later <code>clean</code> undoing the fix.</span
            >
            <span lang="es"
              >Algunas aplicaciones WAR mantenían el descriptor web.xml en
              ubicaciones distintas de las esperadas. La pipeline dividía el
              build en fases: compilar, detectar los módulos WAR y sus rutas
              efectivas, normalizar el descriptor en el momento correcto del
              ciclo Maven, y continuar el empaquetado sin que un <code
                >clean</code
              > posterior deshiciera la adaptación.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sk-legacy-card">
          <span class="sk-legacy-card__title">
            <span lang="en">Externally generated configuration</span>
            <span lang="es"
              >Configuración externa generada durante el build</span
            >
          </span>
          <p class="sk-legacy-card__body">
            <span lang="en"
              >Several applications consumed configuration files external to the
              deployable artefact. The new pipeline preserved this via
              controlled temp directories: Maven handled filtering and
              transformation, and the result was distributed to the correct
              remote filesystem — no config baked into the WAR/EAR.</span
            >
            <span lang="es"
              >Varias aplicaciones consumían configuración externa al artefacto
              desplegable. La nueva pipeline mantuvo este comportamiento con
              directorios temporales controlados: Maven filtraba y transformaba,
              y el resultado se distribuía al filesystem remoto correspondiente,
              sin meter configuración dentro del WAR o EAR.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="sk-legacy-card">
          <span class="sk-legacy-card__title">
            <span lang="en">Resolving artefacts in Nexus</span>
            <span lang="es">Resolución de artefactos en Nexus</span>
          </span>
          <p class="sk-legacy-card__body">
            <span lang="en"
              >Deployment stopped depending on the local build result. Nexus
              became the source of truth, supporting three modes: build +
              publish + deploy, build only, or deploy an already-published
              version — decoupling the build cycle from the deploy cycle.</span
            >
            <span lang="es"
              >El despliegue dejó de depender del resultado local del build.
              Nexus pasó a ser la fuente de verdad, con tres modos posibles:
              build + publicación + despliegue, solo build, o despliegue de una
              versión ya publicada — desacoplando construcción y despliegue.</span
            >
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Orchestrator -->
      <div class="sk-legacy-card sk-orchestrator-card" data-reveal data-d="120">
        <span class="sk-legacy-card__title">
          <span lang="en">Orchestrating dependent applications</span>
          <span lang="es">Orquestar aplicaciones dependientes</span>
        </span>
        <p class="sk-legacy-card__body">
          <span lang="en"
            >Applications had to run in a specific sequence. The new
            orchestrator:</span
          >
          <span lang="es"
            >Las aplicaciones debían ejecutarse en una secuencia concreta. El
            nuevo orquestador:</span
          >
        </p>
        <ul class="sk-bullet-list">
          <li>
            <span lang="en">Loaded execution order from a Managed File.</span>
            <span lang="es"
              >Cargaba el orden de ejecución desde un Managed File.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <span lang="en"
              >Ran pipelines sequentially, by the selected variant.</span
            >
            <span lang="es"
              >Ejecutaba los pipelines secuencialmente, según la variante
              seleccionada.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <span lang="en">Accepted branch, tag or version.</span>
            <span lang="es">Aceptaba branch, tag o versión.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span lang="en"
              >Allowed starting or stopping at a specific point.</span
            >
            <span lang="es"
              >Permitía empezar o detener la secuencia en un punto concreto.</span
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <span lang="en">Stopped on the first failure.</span>
            <span lang="es">Interrumpía la ejecución ante el primer fallo.</span
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 04 SCOPE + VALIDATION ============ -->
  <section class="sk-section" id="sk-scope">
    <div class="sk-section__inner">
      <span class="sk-section-label" data-reveal>
        <span lang="en">04 — Scope implemented</span>
        <span lang="es">04 — Alcance implementado</span>
      </span>

      <h2 class="sk-h2" data-reveal data-d="40">
        <span lang="en"
          >A base built to extend, not a closed solution for 17 apps.</span
        >
        <span lang="es"
          >Una base preparada para crecer, no una solución cerrada para 17 apps.</span
        >
      </h2>

      <p class="sk-body" data-reveal data-d="80">
        <span lang="en"
          >The first phase considered 34 potential pipelines — 17 applications
          with two operational variants each. The architecture was designed as
          an extensible base, not a closed set.</span
        >
        <span lang="es"
          >La primera fase contemplaba 34 pipelines potenciales: 17 aplicaciones
          con dos variantes operativas cada una. La arquitectura se diseñó como
          una base extensible, no como un conjunto cerrado.</span
        >
      </p>

      <div class="sk-stat-row" data-reveal data-d="120">
        <div class="sk-stat-cell">
          <div class="sk-stat-cell__value">17</div>
          <div class="sk-stat-cell__label">
            <span lang="en">Main pipelines</span>
            <span lang="es">Pipelines principales</span>
          </div>
        </div>
